---
title: 'Figure 2: Project and Concept Processing Stage (Compact Version)'
---
%%{init: {'flowchart': {'nodeSpacing': 15, 'rankSpacing': 40}}}%%
%% nodeSpacing controls horizontal space between nodes
%% rankSpacing controls vertical space between ranks

graph TD
%% Input Data Artifacts from Previous Stage
    B1[<strong>Project List</strong><br/><i>Quantum computing repositories</i>]
    A1[<strong>Pattern Definitions</strong><br/><i>59 patterns</i>]

%% Processing Steps
    C[<strong>3. Extract Notebooks</strong><br/><i>notebooks/ directory</i>]
    D[<strong>4. Convert Notebooks</strong><br/><i>converted_notebooks/ folder</i>]
    E[<strong>5. Extract Concepts</strong><br/><i>*_quantum_concepts.csv</i>]
    F[<strong>6. Manual Classification</strong><br/><i>enriched_*.csv files</i>]

%% Intermediate & Final Data Artifacts of this stage
    D1[<strong>Python Files</strong><br/><i>Converted .py files</i>]
    F1[<strong>Classified Concepts</strong><br/><i>Concepts with patterns</i>]

%% Connections
    B1 --> C --> D --> D1
    A1 --> F --> F1
    B1 --> E --> F


%% Styling with larger fonts
%% Font sizes have been increased for better readability within a column.
    classDef process fill:white,color:black,stroke:black,stroke-width:2px,font-size:20px
    classDef data fill:white,color:black,stroke:black,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray: 3 3,font-size:20px

%% Apply styles
    class B1,A1,D1,F1 data
    class C,D,E,F process